<td>

<h3>How It Works</h3>
<p>Experiential learning is a required component of tCAP and gives students the opportunity to apply classroom knowledge in real-world environments.</p>
<table style="border-style: none;">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="border-style: none;">
<table class="media-small-left">
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="ou-help mceNonEditable">Image - Small - Left <br />Image Dimensions - Width: 100 px, Height: 100 px* <br />* Recommended Height.</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="image"><img src="{{f:82757024}}" alt="1" width="1254" height="1254" /></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<strong><span style="color: #006747; font-size: 1.25em; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase;">Choose an experience</span></strong>
<p>Select an eligible pathway such as an internship, research, capstone, hackathon or study abroad experience.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>
<table class="media-small-left">
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="ou-help mceNonEditable">News - Image - Small - Left <br />Image Width: 100 px, Height: 100 px* <br />* Recommended Height.</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="image"><img src="{{f:82757023}}" alt="2" width="1254" height="1254" /></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<strong><span style="color: #006747; font-size: 1.25em; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase;">Get pre-approval</span></strong>
<p>Pre-approval of a plan of work and faculty mentor or quality supervisor.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>
<table class="media-small-left">
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="ou-help mceNonEditable">News - Image - Small - Left <br />Image Width: 100 px, Height: 100 px* <br />* Recommended Height.</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="image"><img src="{{f:82757025}}" alt="3" width="1254" height="1254" /></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<strong><span style="color: #006747; font-size: 1.25em; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase;">Complete the work</span></strong>
<p>Meet the minimum threshold of 135 verified hours and deliver a mid-point update.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>
<table class="media-small-left">
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="ou-help mceNonEditable">News - Image - Small - Left <br />Image Width: 100 px, Height: 100 px* <br />* Recommended Height.</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="image"><img src="{{f:82757026}}" alt="4" width="1254" height="1254" /></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<strong><span style="color: #006747; font-size: 1.25em; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase;">Reflect and record</span></strong>
<p>Develop and deliver a final report with structured reflection, pass/fail assessment and CIS 4950 notation.</p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h3>Approved Pathways</h3>
<p>Eligible experiences include internships, undergraduate research through USF Student Engagement in Research &amp; Innovation, capstone projects, cybersecurity support services, entrepreneurship initiatives, competitions, hackathons and study abroad experiences.</p>
<h3>Requirements</h3>
<table class="table-bordered" style="margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;"><caption>What Students Need to Complete</caption>
<thead>
<tr>
<th scope="col">Requirement</th>
<th scope="col">What it means</th>
<th scope="col">Student output<br />&nbsp;</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>135 verified hours</td>
<td>Minimum threshold of 135 verified hours</td>
<td>Tracked hours<br />&nbsp;</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Pre-approval</td>
<td>Pre-approval of a plan of work and faculty mentor or quality supervisor</td>
<td>Approved plan of work<br /><br /></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Documentation</td>
<td>Plan of work, mid-point update and final report with structured reflection</td>
<td>Plan, update and final report<br />&nbsp;</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Assessment</td>
<td>Pass/fail assessment using a common rubric</td>
<td>Pass/fail result</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>CIS 4950</td>
<td>Recorded as CIS 4950 (badge and transcript notation)</td>
<td>Badge and transcript notation<br /><br /></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>

</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
